 COVID-19 Pandemic left the overwhelming majority of the Rockaway businesses closed with the distinct possibility of never re-opening.\u00a0<\/p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Our call-to-action focused on three questions:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd023c4 link-list  elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cd023c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li style=\"text-align: left;\">How could locals inform consumers of open businesses and available services while adhering to shelter in place orders?<\/li><li style=\"text-align: left;\">How would we connect locals of open businesses with available services? and<\/li><li>How would RDRC best help businesses that remained open, but in need of assistance?<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f32712 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6f32712\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><span>Monthly Roundup<\/span><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-d8d51d5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d8d51d5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-7d7e97c\" data-id=\"7d7e97c\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-setti